Good afternoon Evan

Thank you for the email.

Although it is rare these days that landlords withdraw a service and apply =
for an above guideline rent increase it does happen.  We actually have the =
ability and space on our application forms (for the above guideline rent in=
crease) to do both at the same time with one officer doing it under one app=
lication  Unfortunately in this instance it didn=E2=80=99t work out that wa=
y (as the rent increase and withdrawal dates are different)  but I was stil=
l assigned both files anyway.  In no way did having both files impact the o=
utcome for the rent increase or upcoming withdrawal.

For the claim process, there is no timeframe as to when you must file a cla=
im.  So no statue of limitations.

Thanks Evan.

David Maclean
