Thank you for your patience.  I have received an email back from the landlo=
rd to advise that your belongings have been moved and the laundry has been =
disconnected.  Although the Branch is firm in its stance that the services =
must remain accessible (in its current state) until the permanent withdrawa=
l date, the Branch cannot do more than tell the landlord this.

The consequence of this though is that the withdrawal date will change.  I =
will be formulating an amount for the rent reduction for the withdrawal of =
the storage and laundry.

I have your current measurements of the unit as 90cm by 60 cm by 60cm.  Do =
you know what the provided locker space is?

Also for laundry; can you let me know where you now have to go for laundry =
services and how often you would have to go.  I also will be doing the same=
 but welcome your input as well.

