 can file a claim with the Branch for financial loss.  This could be, but n=
ot restricted to=E2=80=A6. Any loss of personal items in the storage locker=
, laundry services, locker space.  A hearing would take place and a hearing=
 officer would make a ruling based on the evidence provided.

Please let me know if you have any questions, thank you Evan



